<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Nov 15 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 8000, tin down 260, lead down 800, zinc down 2075,</p>
<p>aluminium down 4075, nickel up 570, aluminium alloy down 20</p>
</text>
